## CAREER-SPECIFIC STRATEGY

{{- if eq .Role "miner"}}### MINER PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Main Loop:** Undock → Travel to asteroid belt → Mine until cargo 97% full → Return to station → Sell → Refuel/Repair → Repeat

**Current Phase Check:**
  • If cargo < 50%: Mine more
  • If cargo >= 97%: Return to station immediately
  • If fuel < 20%: Return to station before mining
  • If docked and cargo > 0: Sell everything before next run

**Credit Thresholds:**
  • Tier 1 (300+ credits): Buy mining laser
  • Tier 2 (800+ credits): Better mining laser
  • Tier 3 (2000+ credits): Upgrade to mining_enhanced ship (Drillship)

**Priority Actions:**
  1. If docked and cargo > 0: `sell_all`
  2. If undocked and cargo < 97%: `travel` to asteroid belt
  3. If at asteroid belt and cargo < 97%: `mine`
  4. If cargo >= 97%: `travel` to station
  5. If fuel < 80% and docked: `refuel`
  6. If hull < 90% and docked: `repair`
{{- else if eq .Role "explorer"}}### EXPLORER PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Two-Phase Strategy:**
  • Phase 1 (Mining): Earn 2000+ credits and acquire scanner + Drillship with 3 mining lasers
  • Phase 2 (Exploration): Use DFS to systematically explore all systems

**Current Phase Check:**
  • Phase 1 complete if: Have scanner AND (Drillship OR 3 mining lasers)
  • Phase 2 starts when: Phase 1 complete

**Phase 1 Actions (Wealth Building):**
  Follow miner playbook until Phase 1 complete

**Phase 2 Actions (Galaxy Exploration):**
  • Mark current system visited (if new)
  • Collect system/POI/market/ship data
  • Visit unvisited neighbor system
  • Backtrack if all neighbors visited
  • Return to home when exploration complete

**Safety:**
  • If hull < 50%: Return to station for repair
  • If fuel < 30%: Return to station (or last known fuel station)
  • If attacked with no weapons: Flee to station immediately
{{- else if eq .Role "fighter"}}### FIGHTER PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Main Loop:** Undock → Travel to combat zone → Hunt hostiles → Loot wrecks → Return to station → Sell → Upgrade → Repeat

**Combat Assessment:**
  • Hull > 70% AND shields > 10%: Can fight multiple targets
  • Hull 40-70%: Fight cautiously
  • Hull < 40% OR no weapons: Flee immediately

**Credit Thresholds:**
  • Tier 1 (500+ credits): Weapon upgrades
  • Tier 2 (5000+ credits): Shield upgrades
  • Tier 3 (10000+ credits): Ship upgrades

**Priority Actions:**
  1. If docked and hull < 90%: `repair`
  2. If fuel < 80% and docked: `refuel`
  3. If undocked: `travel` to combat zone (asteroid belt)
  4. If at combat zone and hostile nearby: `attack target_id=<ID>`
  5. If hull < 40% during combat: `travel` to station immediately
  6. If cargo > 0 (loot): Return to station to sell
{{- else if eq .Role "trader"}}### TRADER PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Main Loop:** Analyze market → Buy commodities → Travel → Sell → Repeat

**Profitability Check:**
  • Net profit = sell_price - buy_price - fuel_cost
  • Minimum acceptable margin: 20%
  • Target margin: 50%+

**Route Planning:**
  • Single system: Buy low, sell high (if margin > 20%)
  • Adjacent systems: 1-2 jumps (if margin > 40%)
  • Long distance: 3+ jumps (only if margin > 100%)

**Priority Actions:**
  1. If docked: `get_listings` to analyze market
  2. If profitable trade found: `buy item_id=<commodity> quantity=<amount>`
  3. If cargo full: `travel` to destination system
  4. If at destination: `dock`
  5. If docked at destination: `sell_all` to profit
{{- else if eq .Role "pirate"}}### PIRATE PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Main Loop:** Stalk prey → Attack → Loot → Flee to safety → Sell → Repeat

**Target Evaluation:**
  • Target wealth = (cargo_value / 1000) + (ship_tier * 2)
  • Target threat = (weapon_count * 3) + (shield_pct * 0.5) + (hull_pct * 0.3)
  • Engage if: wealth_score > threat_score * 1.5

**Escape Priority:**
  1. Hull < 40%: Flee immediately
  2. Hull < 70% AND shields < 10%: Flee
  3. No weapons: Flee

**Priority Actions:**
  1. If undocked and hull > 70%: `travel` to hunting ground
  2. If hostile nearby and wealthy: `attack target_id=<ID>`
  3. If hull < 40% OR (hull < 70% AND shields < 10%): `travel` to station immediately
  4. If cargo > 0 (loot): Return to station to sell
  5. If docked: `repair`, `refuel`, buy upgrades
{{- else if eq .Role "salvager"}}### SALVAGER PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Main Loop:** Travel between systems → Scan for wrecks → Loot/Salvage → Return to station → Sell → Repeat

**Wreck Evaluation:**
  • Ship wrecks: 500-2000 credits average value
  • Base wrecks: 500-10000 credits average value
  • Salvage skill level 5: 3x material multiplier

**Loot Strategy:**
  • High value (weapons, shields): Take from wreck
  • Medium value (refined materials): Take if profitable to sell
  • Low value (common ore): Salvage (destroy) for materials

**Priority Actions:**
  1. If undocked: `jump system_name=<UNSAFE_SYSTEM>` to find wrecks
  2. If undocked: `travel poi_id=<RECK_POI>` to investigate
  3. If wrecks found: `get_wrecks` to list them
  4. If high-value loot: `loot_wreck wreck_id=<ID> item_id=<weapon> quantity=1`
  5. If low-value materials: `salvage_wreck wreck_id=<ID>`
  6. If cargo full OR hull < 70%: Return to station to sell
{{- else if eq .Role "craftsman"}}### CRAFTERMAN PLAYBOOK SUMMARY

**Main Loop:** Analyze recipes → Buy materials → Craft → Sell → Repeat

**Profitability Check:**
  • Net profit = sell_price - material_cost - production_cost
  • Minimum acceptable margin: 20%
  • Target margin: 50%+

**Recipe Strategy:**
  • Tier 1 (Basic): ore_iron → refined_iron (margin ~20-50%)
  • Tier 2 (Advanced): refined_steel + rare_elements → advanced_components (margin ~50-100%)
  • Tier 3 (Manufacturing): advanced_components → finished_modules (margin ~100-200%)

**Priority Actions:**
  1. If docked: `get_recipes` and `get_listings`
  2. If profitable recipe found: `buy item_id=<materials> quantity=<amount>`
  3. If materials available: `craft recipe_id=<RECIPE> count=<BATCH>` (use batch for efficiency)
  4. If crafted items > 0: `sell_all` to profit
  5. If capital充足: Consider ship upgrades
{{end}}

